禹曰：「何謂孳孳？」禹曰：「鴻水滔天，浩浩懷山襄陵，下民皆服於水。予陸行乘車，水行乘舟，泥行乘橇，山行乘檋，行山栞木。與益予衆庶稻鮮食。以決九川致四海，浚畎澮致之川。與稷予衆庶難得之食。食少，調有餘補不足，徙居。衆民乃定，萬國爲治。」皋陶曰：「然，此而美也。」","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m021-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"帝舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m021-0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m021-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m021-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m021-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m021-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m021-0094","start":94,"end":95,"surface":"益","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000051","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m021-0118","start":118,"end":119,"surface":"稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m021-0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-002-xia","book_id":"b-shiji-002","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-002-xia"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:p024","text":"皋陶於是敬禹之德，令民皆則禹。不如言，刑從之。舜德大明。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m024-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m024-0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m024-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m024-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-002-xia","book_id":"b-shiji-002","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-002-xia"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:p025","text":"於是夔行樂，祖考至，羣后相讓，鳥獸翔舞，簫韶九成，鳳皇來儀，百獸率舞，百官信諧。帝用此作歌曰：「陟天之命，維時維幾。」乃歌曰：「股肱喜哉，元首起哉，百工熙哉！」皋陶拜手稽首揚言曰：「念哉，率爲興事，慎乃憲，敬哉！」乃更爲歌曰：「元首明哉，股肱良哉，庶事康哉！」又歌曰：「元首叢脞哉，股肱惰哉，萬事墮哉！」帝拜曰：「然，往欽哉！」於是天下皆宗禹之明度數聲樂，爲山川神主。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m025-0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"夔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000048","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m025-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"祖考","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、氏族、官職或未定指代；不推造個別姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m025-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段與前後段的帝舜及對話敘事暫定為舜，非全篇所有「帝」的自動對應。"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m025-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m025-0152","start":152,"end":153,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段與前後段的帝舜及對話敘事暫定為舜，非全篇所有「帝」的自動對應。"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m025-0170","start":170,"end":171,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-002-xia","book_id":"b-shiji-002","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-002-xia"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:p027","text":"帝禹立而舉皋陶薦之，且授政焉，而皋陶卒。封皋陶之後於英、六，或在許。而后舉益，任之政。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m027-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"帝禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m027-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m027-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m027-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-002-xia:m027-0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"益","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000051","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-002-xia","book_id":"b-shiji-002","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-002-xia"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p009","text":"湯歸至于泰卷陶，中𤳹作誥。既絀夏命，還亳，作湯誥：「維三月，王自至於東郊。告諸侯群后：『毋不有功於民，勤力迺事。予乃大罰殛女，毋予怨。』曰：『古禹、皋陶久勞于外，其有功乎民，民乃有安。東為江，北為濟，西為河，南為淮，四瀆已修，萬民乃有居。后稷降播，農殖百穀。三公咸有功于民，故后有立。昔蚩尤與其大夫作亂百姓，帝乃弗予，有狀。先王言不可不勉。』曰：『不道，毋之在國，女毋我怨。』」以令諸侯。伊尹作咸有一德，咎單作明居。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"中𤳹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000099","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"只依本段對話的君主與事件暫定，不作全篇通用的帝／王匹配。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"三公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"蚩尤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000003","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0154","start":154,"end":158,"surface":"帝乃弗予","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0194","start":194,"end":196,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"咎單","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000100","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p030","text":"舜之後，周武王封之陳，至楚惠王滅之，有世家言。禹之後，周武王封之杞，楚惠王滅之，有世家言。契之後為殷，殷有本紀言。殷破，周封其後於宋，齊湣王滅之，有世家言。后稷之後為周，秦昭王滅之，有本紀言。皋陶之後，或封英、六，楚穆王滅之，無譜。伯夷之後，至周武王復封於齊，曰太公望，陳氏滅之，有世家言。伯翳之後，至周平王時封為秦，項羽滅之，有本紀言。垂、益、夔、龍，其後不知所封，不見也。右十一人者，皆唐虞之際名有功德臣也；其五人之後皆至帝王，餘乃為顯諸侯。滕、薛、騶，夏、殷、周之閒封也，小，不足齒列，弗論也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000030","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"周武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000150","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"楚惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001415","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0027","start":27,"end":30,"surface":"周武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000150","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-