59","start":159,"end":161,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0169","start":169,"end":170,"surface":"垂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000050","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0171","start":171,"end":172,"surface":"益","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000051","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0173","start":173,"end":174,"surface":"夔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000048","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0175","start":175,"end":176,"surface":"龍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000049","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0195","start":195,"end":197,"surface":"唐虞","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0223","start":223,"end":228,"surface":"滕、薛、騶","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m030-0229","start":229,"end":234,"surface":"夏、殷、周","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引語角色、國別、校勘或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代或成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","book_id":"b-shiji-036","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-036-chenqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p019","text":"穆王立，以其太子宮予潘崇，使爲太師，掌國事。穆王三年，滅江。四年，滅六、蓼。六、蓼，皋陶之後。八年，伐陳。十二年，卒。子莊王侶立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m019-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"穆王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001884","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m019-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"潘崇","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001899","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m019-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"穆王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001884","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"i